WEBVTT

00:03.920 --> 00:06.810
Come on, Setsu. Say hi to Yuhi-chan.

00:09.160 --> 00:10.190
Hey.

00:10.430 --> 00:13.320
Um, uh...

00:13.850 --> 00:15.580
Want to play with me?

00:15.580 --> 00:17.030
No, thanks.

00:17.610 --> 00:18.530
It's too hot.

00:19.030 --> 00:20.540
What?!

00:22.610 --> 00:27.150
<i>At first, he seemed like 
a scary, unfriendly boy.</i>

00:29.000 --> 00:31.390
<i>But because we lived so close,</i>

00:31.390 --> 00:33.530
<i>we spent a lot of time together.</i>

00:34.960 --> 00:39.500
<i>He helped me with school, 
played with me, and over time...</i>

00:40.700 --> 00:43.810
<i>As I learned how kind he was, I...</i>

00:47.500 --> 00:48.310
What's wrong?

00:53.180 --> 00:58.750
Would I have to go to a place like this if 
I wanted to go to the same high school as you?

00:59.330 --> 01:02.930
<b>L Academy</b>

00:59.330 --> 01:02.930
<b>Free Trial 
Available</b>

01:00.450 --> 01:03.030
Just kidding. Let's go home.

01:03.030 --> 01:05.330
I have to help make dinner.

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
This year, become the invincible you.

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
<b>Study Period</b>

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
<b>Summer Classes</b>

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
One-on-one lessons to 
tackle your weaknesses!

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
An environment to 
boost motivation!

01:05.330 --> 01:07.830
Two minutes from station exit 2

01:14.320 --> 01:15.090
Hey!

01:17.810 --> 01:21.850
What do you think... about what I said?

01:26.640 --> 01:30.980
Maybe you should aim for an easier school.

01:31.400 --> 01:34.760
We don't have to go to the same 
school if it's too much trouble.

01:34.760 --> 01:38.380
You'd just make things harder 
for yourself in the long run.

01:44.330 --> 01:46.870
I get it. Never mind.

01:48.750 --> 01:50.380
Hey, Yuhi?

01:55.880 --> 01:58.880
<b>Modern Japanese   Free Phoneme   Verb 
 Adjective    Adjective Verb    Noun   Adverb</b>

02:05.890 --> 02:06.850
See ya.

02:05.890 --> 02:07.580
<b>L Academy</b>

02:17.400 --> 02:19.910
<b>Nationwide Mock Exam Personal Grades Sheet 1</b>

02:17.400 --> 02:19.910
Second Mock Exam Results

02:17.400 --> 02:19.910
Subject           Score    Adjusted  Grade

02:17.400 --> 02:19.910
English 
 Listening 
 Math I 
 Math II 
 Japanese 




 Basic Chemistry 
 Basic Biology 
 Japanese History 
 World History

02:20.870 --> 02:24.000
I guess I'm not good enough...

02:28.860 --> 02:31.920
Hey, why the gloomy face?

02:31.920 --> 02:34.690
Were your mock exam results bad?

02:36.640 --> 02:39.640
Poor thing. She looks crushed.

02:39.640 --> 02:40.930
Seriously?

02:40.930 --> 02:44.670
If it's beyond your abilities, 
just give up. You'll have more fun.

02:44.670 --> 02:46.400
I...

02:46.400 --> 02:49.010
Deep down, you get it, don't you?

02:49.850 --> 02:53.190
Just stop studying and hang out with us.

02:53.480 --> 02:54.970
Come on, let's do it.

02:54.970 --> 02:57.010
Let's play. We know more fun stuff.

02:57.010 --> 02:59.400
Let's let all the stress out, right?

02:57.770 --> 02:59.400
Uh, sorry, guys.

03:00.800 --> 03:05.330
We're busy studying,
 so please find someone else to pick on.

03:05.330 --> 03:06.450
Huh?

03:06.680 --> 03:08.200
Yuki-kun...

03:08.560 --> 03:10.030
"Yuki-kun"?

03:10.030 --> 03:12.090
What, she has a guy?

03:12.090 --> 03:14.080
Sorry to bother you.

03:14.080 --> 03:16.020
Damn, what a buzzkill.

03:16.020 --> 03:17.870
Let's go grab something to eat.

03:17.870 --> 03:18.640
Yeah.

03:22.020 --> 03:23.770
Why are you here?

03:23.770 --> 03:26.030
So? What are you going to do?

03:26.030 --> 03:28.220
Huh? What do you mean?

03:29.180 --> 03:32.720
What they said wasn't entirely wrong.

03:33.290 --> 03:35.730
Reaching beyond your 
limits won't help anyone.

03:58.320 --> 03:59.760
I...

04:00.400 --> 04:03.390
Even if people tell me I'm not good enough,

04:03.390 --> 04:07.990
I still want to go to the same school as you.

04:21.270 --> 04:23.280
Then there's no other way, I guess.

04:24.360 --> 04:26.800
If that's what you're determined to do,

04:26.800 --> 04:29.030
I'll have to buckle down and pitch in.

04:29.460 --> 04:30.070
Huh?

04:30.590 --> 04:33.290
I'm saying I'll help you study.

04:33.540 --> 04:37.540
But I won't go easy on you, no matter 
how much you cry and complain.

04:42.560 --> 04:45.180
Yes, please! Thank you!

04:47.550 --> 04:55.600
<i>I wanted to be with Yuki-kun, 
who I love so much, forever...</i>

06:31.450 --> 06:35.950
<b><i>Episode 5</i></b>

06:31.450 --> 06:35.950
<b><i>Following Footsteps for a Second Time</i></b>

06:36.740 --> 06:38.460
Open fire!

06:43.690 --> 06:45.000
We did it!

06:45.280 --> 06:46.640
It worked!

06:46.640 --> 06:49.050
I know, right?! It's awesome!

06:59.760 --> 07:00.770
Finish!

07:05.590 --> 07:07.680
Yuhi-san, that was impressive.

07:07.680 --> 07:10.030
The others have improved a lot, as well.

07:10.970 --> 07:12.980
We'll call it a day for now.

07:12.980 --> 07:14.280
Good work, everyone.

07:14.960 --> 07:16.740
Thank you!

07:17.890 --> 07:19.990
Good work, guys.

07:19.990 --> 07:21.290
I'm so hungry.

07:25.930 --> 07:28.300
Um, do you have a moment?

07:29.840 --> 07:34.550
You're Yuki-kun's friends from 
the last time he was here...

07:35.030 --> 07:37.560
Or rather, his companions, right?

07:39.460 --> 07:43.880
That's right. We still see him 
as a friend and a companion.

07:44.440 --> 07:47.690
Setsu-sama tends to draw 
others in unconsciously,

07:48.610 --> 07:52.040
so who knows if he feels 
the same way about us?

07:55.150 --> 07:57.700
I still have the utmost respect for him,

07:58.410 --> 08:03.710
and wish I could stand by him forever 
and gaze at the same scenery with him.

08:10.210 --> 08:12.220
Anyway, what is your question?

08:14.090 --> 08:17.990
C-Can you give me special training?!

08:17.990 --> 08:20.850
I want to be with Yuki-kun, too!

08:32.440 --> 08:36.620
This is the peaceful world 
that Setsu-sama created.

08:37.710 --> 08:42.090
And, as we speak, Setsu-sama is surely 
fighting somewhere beyond this sky we see

08:42.090 --> 08:45.120
to maintain peace in this world.

08:49.870 --> 08:52.840
As Setsu-sama's companions,

08:53.130 --> 08:58.850
we're staying prepared so we 
can act at a moment's notice.

09:02.000 --> 09:07.280
I have both the desire to be with Yuki-kun 
and the determination to do what it takes.

09:07.280 --> 09:10.700
But I lack the strength, so...

09:13.990 --> 09:15.280
Elka-san,

09:16.580 --> 09:17.900
please!

09:19.760 --> 09:23.760
Once you've spoken those words to me...

09:25.120 --> 09:27.710
I'll never let you say you were just joking!

09:33.510 --> 09:34.340
Here I come!

09:41.340 --> 09:42.180
It's not over!

09:57.130 --> 10:01.310
You've grown much stronger than you realize.

10:02.790 --> 10:06.170
All of the kids that came from 
the other world are exceptional,

10:06.170 --> 10:08.250
but you're quite special, even among them.

10:11.240 --> 10:15.600
But still, if you wish to 
stand by Setsu-sama's side,

10:15.600 --> 10:18.610
there is something you definitely lack.

10:26.930 --> 10:30.000
What's the thing that I lack?

10:31.430 --> 10:34.380
This is a sewer infested with monsters.

10:34.700 --> 10:37.900
We sometimes use this as a final 
training ground for soldiers.

10:38.400 --> 10:41.370
M-Monsters? Final training?

10:43.470 --> 10:45.560
Here it comes.

10:45.560 --> 10:46.370
Huh?

11:07.460 --> 11:09.540
This is no time to be startled!

11:15.400 --> 11:17.230
Now fight!

11:24.480 --> 11:26.160
Don't flinch! Fight!

11:26.160 --> 11:29.160
You have more than enough strength!

11:30.310 --> 11:31.670
Elka-san!

11:38.670 --> 11:41.680
I did it! I fought!

11:41.680 --> 11:42.950
Don't let your guard down!

11:58.120 --> 11:58.730
Now!

11:58.730 --> 12:00.530
Take this!

12:13.560 --> 12:15.480
H-Haven't you had enough?

12:15.480 --> 12:17.370
You're hurt. If you move now...

12:17.370 --> 12:18.690
Finish it.

12:20.510 --> 12:22.910
You have indeed become stronger.

12:22.910 --> 12:26.850
In terms of magic ability alone, 
you're almost equal to me.

12:26.850 --> 12:27.930
But...

12:27.930 --> 12:29.530
This is war.

12:30.320 --> 12:32.760
Kill the enemy, or they 
will kill your friends.

12:32.760 --> 12:34.520
The other side thinks the same way.

12:35.180 --> 12:39.570
If you want to protect those dear to you,
 you must fight and end lives.

12:39.860 --> 12:43.570
<i>That</i> determination is what you lack.

12:44.600 --> 12:47.570
The determination... to take lives...

13:10.180 --> 13:11.680
Elka-san...

13:23.690 --> 13:27.430
This is what I lack...

13:47.420 --> 13:49.170
Yes, come in!

13:50.320 --> 13:52.550
Hey there. Mind if I come in?

14:01.760 --> 14:03.440
There, that's better.

14:04.670 --> 14:07.460
Thank you. I appreciate it.

14:07.460 --> 14:12.960
Elka was crazy to throw you into 
a real battle so suddenly.

14:12.960 --> 14:16.200
No, I asked for it.

14:20.130 --> 14:24.090
I see you as one of us, too.

14:24.490 --> 14:25.270
Huh?

14:25.270 --> 14:28.840
We don't know what Setsu was 
like in the other world,

14:29.980 --> 14:35.770
but he looks at you the same way he looks at us.

14:38.150 --> 14:42.110
That's also why I understand 
where Elka's coming from.

14:42.800 --> 14:45.720
We can't teach determination.

14:45.720 --> 14:50.700
Elka is hard on you because she 
wants to treat you as a true equal.

14:52.000 --> 14:53.530
Thea-san...

14:53.900 --> 14:58.080
Why do you want to be with Setsu so badly?

14:58.540 --> 15:01.880
You know being near him will 
put you in lots of danger.

15:03.800 --> 15:08.630
Because Yuki-kun has helped 
me out my whole life.

15:15.170 --> 15:20.390
So, this time, I want to be the one to help him.

15:20.390 --> 15:21.610
I see.

15:24.420 --> 15:29.120
Well, all we can do is meddle,
 but I do wish you good luck.

15:29.120 --> 15:30.060
Thanks!

15:35.920 --> 15:39.320
It'll be all right. Yuhi is strong.

15:39.320 --> 15:41.670
That much is obvious.

15:42.420 --> 15:48.550
Defending herself on the battlefield 
should be easy for her at this point.

15:49.110 --> 15:52.320
But if she fights alongside us,

15:53.010 --> 15:56.550
who knows what kind of dangerous 
foes she'll eventually face?

15:57.240 --> 16:02.920
And you don't think Setsu wants us to 
force that kind of determination on Yuhi?

16:05.270 --> 16:09.990
But that's not for us to decide, 
and not for Setsu to decide, either.

16:09.990 --> 16:11.920
It's all up to Yuhi herself.

16:11.920 --> 16:16.350
All we can do is respect the determination 
that Yuhi finds for herself.

16:19.320 --> 16:21.490
I'll sleep a bit more.

16:21.490 --> 16:22.530
Goodnight.

16:26.590 --> 16:27.750
I...

16:29.250 --> 16:30.630
Excuse me.

16:44.690 --> 16:46.200
Is this about last night?

16:46.200 --> 16:47.520
Glein-san...

16:50.600 --> 16:54.400
Being hesitant about taking lives is natural.

16:54.400 --> 16:58.410
Even if it's for the sake 
of someone precious to you.

16:59.940 --> 17:04.040
Glein-san, how did you gather 
the determination to fight?

17:05.110 --> 17:08.230
I just chose to make others suffer,

17:09.110 --> 17:11.970
rather than watch the 
people around me suffer.

17:12.810 --> 17:14.420
Like any other soldier.

17:18.600 --> 17:22.180
But that's just what works for me.

17:24.320 --> 17:26.450
You have your own determination.

17:26.920 --> 17:30.690
You have to find the answer by yourself.

17:31.100 --> 17:32.370
<i>My...</i>

17:34.030 --> 17:35.190
<i>determination...</i>

17:36.950 --> 17:40.890
Setsu-san probably wants you to come up 
with the answer that best suits you.

17:46.510 --> 17:51.320
<i>I want to stay true to myself, 
yet I want to fight...</i>

18:33.290 --> 18:35.750
Since you've returned,

18:35.750 --> 18:38.550
does that mean you've 
found your determination?

18:39.830 --> 18:42.150
Yes. I've made my decision.

19:06.640 --> 19:10.460
Forcing yourself out of your 
comfort zone in battle might break you.

19:10.960 --> 19:15.960
Elka-san, please witness my determination.

19:52.420 --> 19:53.640
Impressive.

19:54.570 --> 19:57.360
Outstanding power and accuracy alike.

19:57.360 --> 20:00.550
Yuhi-san, I'll admit, your determination is—

20:00.940 --> 20:01.970
No.

20:04.540 --> 20:05.930
It's not dead.

20:07.800 --> 20:10.300
I just temporarily incapacitated it.

20:12.880 --> 20:17.150
This is my determination:
to never take a life.

20:17.150 --> 20:21.570
I will never lose, and I will 
never take anyone's life!

20:22.170 --> 20:23.570
Yuhi-san...

20:26.360 --> 20:30.480
Well, you got me. That answer 
is just like Setsu-sama's.

20:31.640 --> 20:33.630
I'm impressed by your determination,

20:34.130 --> 20:36.960
but that would require an astounding 
amount of power to pull off.

20:36.960 --> 20:41.080
Yes! I'll become much, much stronger!

20:43.480 --> 20:46.250
<i>So that I can protect Elka-san, Yuki-kun,</i>

20:48.580 --> 20:50.640
<i>and everyone else.</i>

20:55.190 --> 20:57.230
The king has issued his decree.

20:58.560 --> 21:02.880
We, the Knights of Distinia, in order 
to protect our nation and its citizens,

21:02.880 --> 21:07.240
will leave tomorrow at dawn for 
the demonic nation of Eviltheon.

21:08.240 --> 21:11.720
Everyone, prepare yourselves, 
both physically and mentally!

21:12.530 --> 21:13.500
Dismissed!

21:13.500 --> 21:15.560
So the time is finally here...

21:13.500 --> 21:15.560
I have to fight. I don't wanna die...

21:15.560 --> 21:17.130
Can I really shoot a person?

21:15.560 --> 21:18.500
Can we really fight, 
after such brief training?

21:32.110 --> 21:34.220
Wait for me, Yuki-kun.

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:26.960 --> 23:31.970
<b><i>Master and Pupil for a Second Time</i></b>

23:27.760 --> 23:31.010
Next time: "Master and 
Pupil for a Second Time."
